{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"secret","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A multiline holdout phrase in a changed file is returned to the agent without redaction, exposing private scenario content."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"secret","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A verifier-observed private value can appear unredacted in the change view when it also occurs in the patch or report."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A stale polling snapshot can cause an agent to review an obsolete head and waste work when its submission is rejected."},{"id":"F4","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A non-default Git configuration can silently omit a changed submodule from an otherwise available review view, potentially leading to an incomplete review."}]}